abstract: >-
  A route accessibility checklist for clinical research sites, pilot walk reports from
  Boston, Cambridge and Somerville (Massachusetts), and summary counts from an anonymous
  survey on getting to medical appointments and research visits. Survey data are real
  responses published only as one-way summary counts; they are not synthetic.
